// FALCONRY (scripts/hunter_falconry.rs2): the gyr falcon you sent, sitting on its catch - the uid of the
// falcon npc spawned where the kebbit was, so that only you can Retrieve it and the glove's timer can
// tell when it has given up and gone home. Null while the falcon is on your glove, or lost.
//
// Everything else about falconry is the glove itself: falconers_glove_falcon worn is a falcon on your
// hand; falconers_glove worn is a falcon out hunting, or lost (the uid null) - which Matthias puts
// right. Temp: a falcon on a catch does not wait through a logout.
[falconry_falcon]
type=npc_uid
scope=temp
